Package: party.jailbreak.omega-ondevice
Name: Omega On-Device
Version: 1.6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Keeps sideloaded apps valid on-device. Config-driven worker that
 neutralises the local revocation state (OCSP cache + the four
 MobileIdentityData ban-lists, rewritten empty and locked immutable; optional
 valid.sqlite3 blanking) and re-applies it at every boot. Each technique is
 toggleable from the native Omega app. Also ships omega-dns: an on-device
 local DNS block (dnsmasq @ 127.0.0.1) for ocsp/ppq/crl/valid.apple.com so
 apps stay valid online without a VPS.
Author: jailbreak.party (on-device port)
Maintainer: Omega
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: dnsmasq
Tag: role::hacker
